# Variant of hnsw_knn_composite_pk_mixed.test that restarts the server after the
# rows are inserted and before any KNN query, to verify the on-disk spilled
# primary keys (the composite keys packed into the PK store) are recovered as
# expected: after restart the index is reloaded from disk and each KNN hit still
# resolves to its correct row by its full composite key.
let $restart = 1;
--source hnsw_knn_composite_pk_mixed.test
